<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">RRK16.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">NEHEMIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">NEHEMIA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemia okuhurira enkuru mbi ahari Yerusaalemu n'okugishabira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:1">Neh 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="EST 1:2">Est 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:2">Dan 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:1">Zek 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo bya Nehemia, mwene Hakalia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Eizooba rimwe omu kwezi kwa Kisileevi omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri, nkaba ndi omu rurembo Suusa, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Neh 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Hanaani, omwe ahari beene waitu, yaija n'abashaija nibaruga Yuda; naababuuza eby'Abayudaaya, abaahonokire batatwarwe omu bukwatwa, n'ebya Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="NEH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:3">Neh 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 2:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 2:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:10">2 Bag 25:10</ref>. </char></note> Bangira bati: Abaahonokire batatwarwe omu bukwatwa, abari omuri eryo ishaza, bari omu busaasi bwingi, n'omu kuhemuka kuhango; orugo rw'amabaare orwa Yerusaalemu rusheenyirwe, n'amarembo gaayo gacwekyereziibwe n'omuriro.<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:4">Neh 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:3">Ezr 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naahuriire ebigambo ebyo, naashutama ahansi, naarira, naamara ebiro ninganya; naaguma niinyesiibyakwo, kandi ninshaba omu maisho ga Ruhanga w'eiguru. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:14">Neh 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:32">9:32</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:4">Dan 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9">Bir 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Naagira nti: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'eiguru, ori Ruhanga Nyamuhanga orikutiinwa, orinda endagaano kandi ogirira embabazi abakukunda, bakoorobera ebiragiro byawe, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:29">1 Bag 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:1">Ezr 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:6">Zab 106:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:18">Dan 9:18</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 9:20">20</ref>. </char></note> tega okutu, kandi oreebe n'amaisho, ohurire okushaba kw'omwiru waawe, oku ndikushaba omu maisho gaawe nyomushana na nyekiro ahabw'Abaisraeli abairu baawe, niinyatura ebibi byabo, ebi twakucumwireho. N'ekya buzima, nyowe n'enju ya tata tukacumura. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:25-27">Bir 4:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:64">28:64</ref>. </char></note> Tukakora ebitahikire ahariiwe, titwayorobera biragiro, ebyatairweho n'eby'emigyenzo ebi waaragiire omugaragwa waawe Musa. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Ijuka ekigambo eki waaragiire omugaragwa waawe ogwo, noogira oti: Ku muricumura, ndyabataataanisiza omu mahanga; <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:2-4">30:2-4</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku muringarukira, mwayorobera ebiragiro byangye, mwabikora, n'obu muriba mutaataanisiziibwe okwo hare aha muheru gw'ensi, ndyabateeranira hamwe, mbaiheyo, mbareete omu nsi ei naatooraine kugumyamu eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="NEH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:29">Bir 9:29</ref>. </char></note> N'abairu baawe, kandi abantu baawe, abu waacungwire n'amaani gaawe amaingi, kandi n'omukono gwawe ogw'amaani. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:29">1 Bag 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:40">2 Bus 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:18">Dan 9:18</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, tega okutu kwawe, ohurire okushaba kw'omwiru waawe, n'okw'abairu baawe, abashemerererwa okutiina eiziina ryawe; ohe omwiru waawe omugisha eri izooba, agirirwe embabazi omu maisho g'omushaija ogu. (Omu bunaku obwo nkaba ndi omuheereza wa viinyo y'omugabe.)<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okutuma Nehemia Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 1:1">Neh 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 1:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:1">Ezr 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kwa Nisani omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Aruta-gizakiseesi, eizooba rimwe viinyo ekaba eri omu maisho g'omugabe naagiihaho, naagimuha. Obundi bwona nkaba ntakaguubwaga nti kubi omu maisho ge. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Omugabe yambuuza ati: Ahabw'enki nooreebeka ogwirwe kubi, haza otarwaire? Ekyo ti kindi, kureka n'obusaasi bw'aha mutima. Ku naakihuriire, naatiina munonga. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Neh 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:31">1 Bag 1:31</ref>. </char></note> Naagira omugabe nti: Karamaare, Nyakusinga! Ekyakunzibiire kuguubwa kubi niki, haza kunu orurembo orurimu ebituuro bya baatatenkuru, rwabaire amatongo, n'amarembo gaarwo gaacwekyereziibwe n'omuriro? <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:4">Neh 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 1:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 2:20">2:20</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:18">Dan 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:12">Ezr 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yangira ati: Mbwenu nooshaba ki? Ntyo naashaba Ruhanga w'eiguru. <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Bwanyima naagira omugabe nti: Nyakusinga omugabe, ku oraabe nookisiima, kandi nyowe omwiru waawe nyine obushongore omu maisho gaawe, nyohereza Yuda, omu rurembo rw'ebituuro bya baatatenkuru, ngarukye ndwombekye. <verse eid="NEH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Omugabe, omwigarire amushutami aha rubaju, yangira ati: Noija kumarayo mwanya ki, kandi oryagaruka ryari? Atyo omugabe yaasiima kuunyohereza; naanye naaragaana nawe obunaku. <verse eid="NEH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:36">Ezr 8:36</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naagira omugabe nti: ku oraabe nookisiima, Nyakusinga, bampe amabaruha g'okutwarira abamashaza ba seeri y'Omugyera, baanyikirize kurabamu kuhika Yuda; <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Ezr 7:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi mpeebwe n'ebaruha y'okutwarira Asafu, omurinzi w'ekibira ky'omugabe, abone kumpa emiti y'okwihamu enkingi z'amarembo g'ekigo kya hekalu, n'ey'orugo rw'orurembo, kandi n'ey'enju ei ndaataahemu. Omugabe yaanyikiriza ebi naashaba; ahakuba omukono gwa Ruhanga wangye omurungi gukaba gundiho.<verse eid="NEH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 8:22">Ezr 8:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naaza aha bamashaza ba seeri y'Omugyera, naabaha amabaruha g'omugabe. Kandi omugabe akaba ayohereize abakuru b'engabo n'ab'aha mbaraasi kunshagara. <verse eid="NEH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:4">13:4</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Sanibalati Omuhoroni na Tobia omuhuuku Omuamoni, ku baahuriire ngu hariho oizire kukorera Abaisraeli ebirungi, kyabagwisa kubi mononga.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 8:32">Ezr 8:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntyo naaza Yerusaalemu, naamarayo ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Bwanyima naimuka nyekiro n'abantu bakye; kandi tinaagambira muntu weena eki Ruhanga wangye antaire aha mutima kukorera Yerusaalemu. Kandi nkaba ntaine ndiijo mbaraasi kureka ei naagyendeireho. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Neh 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kiro naashohora, naaraba omu irembo ry'omu ruhanga, naahika aha iziba ry'Ekijoka, n'aha irembo ry'orubungo, naayetegyereza engo za Yerusaalemu, ezaabaire zisheenyukire, n'amarembo gaarwo agaabaire gacwekyereziibwe n'omuriro. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ntyo naagumizamu naahika aha irembo ry'enshuro, n'aha kiyanja ky'omugabe, kwonka naabura ah'okurabya embaraasi ei naabaire ntembire. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Bwanyima ekyo kiro nainamuka orwo ruhanga, naayetegyereza orwo rugo; bwanyima naakuba, naaraba omu irembo ry'oruhanga, naagarukayo. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Kandi abategyeki tibaamanya i naaba ngiire, nari eki naaba ninkora; kandi nkaba ntakagambiire Bayudaaya, abanyamurwa, abakungu, abatware, nari abandi abaabaire bari ab'okukora omurimo.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 1:3">Neh 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:13">Zab 44:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:4">79:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:9">Yer 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:14">Ezk 5:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 5:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naabagira nti: Nimureeba akabi aku turimu, Yerusaalemu oku ebaire amatongo, n'amarembo gaayo oku gahiire. Mwije twombekye orugo rwa Yerusaalemu, turekye kuguma nitushekyererwa. <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Kandi naabateekyerereza oku omukono gwa Ruhanga wangye gwambereire murungi, kandi n'ebi omugabe yangambiire. Baagira bati: Ka twimukye, twombekye. Batyo baayeteera ebinyomyo kukora omurimo ogwo omurungi. <verse eid="NEH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:13">Ezr 4:13</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 6:4">6:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Sanibalati Omuhoroni na Tobila omuhuuku Omuamoni, na Geshemu Omuharabu, ku baakihuriire, baatushekyerera, baatugaya nibagira bati: Mbwenu eki nimukora ki? Nimwenda kugomera omugabe? <verse eid="NEH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:4">Neh 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Naanye naabagarukamu nti: Ruhanga w'eiguru naija kutuha omugisha, kandi itwe abairu be nitwija kwimuka, twombekye; kwonka imwe timwine mugabo, nari obushoboorozi, n'obu kyakuba ekiijutsyo omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'abombeki b'orugo rwa Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 6:1">Neh 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:1">7:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:4">13:4</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:2">Yoh 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Eliashibu omunyamurwa omukuru yaimuka na beene ishe abanyamurwa, baayombeka eirembo ry'entaama. Baarishoroora, baaritamu enyigi. Bwanyima baashoroora orugo okuhika aha munaara gwa Hamea, n'okuhika aha munaara gwa Hananeeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Haakurataho aba Yeriko; nabo baakuratwa Zakuri mwene Imuri omu kwombeka.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Batabani ba Hasena baayombeka eirembo ry'eby'enyanja; baabyara enkingi zaaryo, baatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo by'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:33">Ezr 8:33</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:21">Neh 3:21</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 3:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Baakuratwa Meremoosi mwene Uriya mwijukuru wa Hakozi, yaahunduuza; haataho Meshulaamu mwene Berekia, mwijukuru wa Meshezabeeli, yaahunduuza; haataho Zadoki mwene Baana, yaahunduuza. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:2">2 Sam 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:27">Neh 3:27</ref>. </char></note> Haataho aba Tekoa, baahunduuza; kwonka abakungu baabo tibarataire mutima ha murimo gwa mukama waabo.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 6:1">Neh 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:1">7:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:39">12:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoyada mwene Pasea, na Meshulaamu mwene Besodeia baahunduuza eirembo erya ira; baabyara enkingi zaaryo, baatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo by'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Haataho Melatia owa Gibeoni, yaahunduuza na Yadoni owa Meronoosi, abashaija ba Gibeoni na Mizipa, abaabaire bari omu butegyeki bw'omutegyeki w'ensi eya seeri y'Omugyera. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Haataho Uzieli, mwene Haruhaaya, ow'omu baheesi b'ezaabu, yaahunduuza. Haataho Hanania, omwe aha barikujwanzya emigaju, yaahunduuza. Bo baagaruraho orugo rwa Yerusaalemu okuhika aha Rugo orugango. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Haataho Refaaya mwene Huuri, omutegyeki w'ekicweka kya Yerusaalemu; yaahunduuza. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Haataho Yedaaya mwene Harumaafu, yaahunduuza ahashungaine n'enju ye; haataho Hatushi mwene Hashabuneia, yaahunduuza. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malakiya mwene Harimu na Hashubu mwene Pahasi-moabu baahunduuza ekicweka ky'orugo, n'omunaara gw'amateekyero. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Haataho Shalumu mwene Haloheeshi, omutegyeki w'ekicweka kya Yerusaalemu, yaahunduuza, we na bahara be. <verse eid="NEH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1">Neh 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Hanuuni n'abatuuzi ba Zanoa baahunduuza Eirembo ry'Oruhanga; baaryombeka, baatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo ey'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo; kandi baahunduuza ekicweka ky'orugo kya mikono rukumi okuhika aha irembo ry'orubungo. <verse eid="NEH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Malakiya mwene Rekabu, omutware w'eishaza rya Besi-hakeremu, yaahunduuza eryo irembo ry'orubungo; yaaryombeka, yaatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo eby'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 12:37">Neh 12:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shalumu mwene Koluhoze, omutware w'eishaza rya Mizipa, yaahunduuza eirembo ry'enshuro; yaaryombeka, yaarishweka, yaatamu enyigi zaaryo, ebyoma byaryo eby'okurikingisa, n'empimbi zaaryo; kandi yaayombeka orugo rw'ekiyanja kya Sheela, ekyabaire kiri omu musiri gw'omugabe, okuhika aha matembero, agarikushuuma nigaruga omu rurembo rwa Daudi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">2 Bag 20:20</ref>. </char></note> Haataho Nehemia mwene Azubuuki, omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Besi-zuuri, yaahunduuza okuhika aharikureebana n'ebituuro bya Daudi, aha biyanja ebi baatibire, n'aha nju y'amamanzi. <verse eid="NEH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Yaakuratwa Abaleevi; Rehumu mwene Baani, haataho Hashabia, omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Keila, yaahunduuza ahabw'eishaza rye. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Haataho beene waabo, baahunduuza; Bavai mwene Henadaadi omutware w'ekicweka ky'eishaza rya Keila; <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />haataho Ezeri mwene Yeshua, omutware wa Mizipa, yaahunduuza ekindi kicweka, ekirikureebana n'ah'orikwinamukira nooza omu ibiikiro ry'eby'okurwanisa aha Keekubo. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:4">Neh 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Haataho Baruki mwene Zabai, yaahunduuza ekindi kicweka, okwiha aha Keekubo okuhika aha rwigi rw'enju ya Eliashibu omunyamurwa omukuru. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:4">Neh 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Haataho Meremoosi mwene Uriya, mwijukuru wa Hakozi, yaahunduuza ekindi kicweka, okwiha ahari orwo rwigi okuhika aha muheru gw'egyo nju. <verse eid="NEH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Yaakuratwa abanyamurwa, ab'omu ruhita, baahunduuza. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Haataho Benyamiini na Hashubu, baahunduuza ahashungaine n'enju yaabo. Haataho Azaria mwene Maaseya, mwijukuru wa Anania, yaahunduuza aha rubaju rw'enju ye. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Yaakuratwa Benui, mwene Henadaadi, yaahunduuza ekindi kicweka, okuruga aha nju ya Azaria okuhika aha Keekubo. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Yer 32:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:28">38:28</ref>. </char></note> Palali mwene Uzai yaahunduuza aharikureebana n'Akeekubo, n'aha munaara ogukwataine n'enju y'omugabe ey'aharuguru, omu kibuga ky'abarinzi. <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:1">Neh 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:43">Ezr 2:43</ref>. </char></note> Yaakuratwa Pedaya mwene Paroshi n'abaheereza b'omuri hekalu, abaabaire batwire Ofeli, baahunduuza okuhika ahashungaine n'eirembo ry'amaizi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, n'omunaara ogukwataine n'orwo rugo. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:5">Neh 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Haataho aba Tekoa, baahunduuza ekindi kicweka ekirikureebana n'omunaara muhango ogukwataine n'orwo rugo, okuhika aha rugo rwa Ofeli.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 23:15">2 Bus 23:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aharuguru y'eirembo ry'embaraasi abanyamurwa baahahunduuza, buri omwe yaahunduuza ahashungaine n'enju ye. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Baakuratwa Zadoki mwene Imeri; yaahunduuza aharikureebana n'enju ye. Haataho Shemaaya, mwene Shekania, omurinzi w'eirembo ry'oburugwa-izooba, nawe yaahunduuza. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:4">Neh 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Haataho Hanania mwene Shelemia, na Hanuni mutabani wa Zalafu owa mukaaga, baahunduuza ekindi kicweka. Haataho Meshulaamu mwene Berekia, yaahunduuza ahashungaine n'ekishengye kye. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Yaakuratwa Malukiya, omwe aha baheesi b'ezaabu; yaahunduuza okuhika aha nju y'abaheereza by'omuri hekalu, n'ey'abashuubuzi, aharikureebana n'eirembo ry'eiteeraniro, n'okuhika aha kishengye kya ruguru eky'aha Keekubo. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1">Neh 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaheesi b'ezaabu n'abashubuuzi baahunduuza ahagati y'ekyo kishengye ekya ruguru eky'aha keekubo n'eirembo ry'entaama.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Sanibalati okubateerera enaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1, 3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:10">Neh 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sanibalati ku yaahuriire ngu nitwombeka orugo rw'amabaare, yaaguubwa kubi, yaagira ekiniga kingi, yaateerera Abayudaaya enaku. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Yaagambira omu maisho ga beene ishe, n'omu maisho g'eihe rya Samaria, ati: Ziriya ntakimazire z'Abayudaaya nizikora ki? Nibenda kweyombekyera ekigo? Nibenda kutamba ebitambo? Nibenda kwombeka ngu baherezeho? Nibabaasa kutabuura amabaare omu mituumo y'ebyasheenyukire, haza gaabaire gaahiire? <verse eid="NEH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Reero Tobia, owaabaire amuri aha rubaju, nawe yaagira ati: N'ekya buzima! Orwo rugo rwabo rw'amabaare, oru barikwombeka, muha ku ekurwemereraho, ekaarubandika ahansi. <verse eid="NEH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:12">Zab 79:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 123:3">123:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 123:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naashaba ningira nti: Ai Ruhanga waitu, hurira; ahabw'okuba tugayirwe. Ebijumo ebi batujumire, obibagarureho, kandi obaheyo, batwarwe omu ndiijo nsi bari enkwatwa, banyagirweyo. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:14">Zab 109:14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:23">Yer 18:23</ref>. </char></note> Otashwekyerera orubanja rwabo, kandi n'ekibi kyabo kitaragazibwa omu maisho gaawe; ahakuba bakugwisiize kubi omu maisho g'abombeki.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Tutyo twayombeka orugo, twaruteerana rwona, rwahika rwagati; ahabw'okuba abantu bakeezirika baakora.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:10">Neh 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Sanibalati na Tobia n'Abaharabu n'Abaamoni n'aba Ashidoodi ku baahuriire ngu omurimo gw'okuhunduuza engo za Yerusaalemu nigugyenda omu maisho, kandi ngu ahaasheenyukire hatandikire kuteeranwa, baagira ekiniga kingi; <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:3-5">Zab 83:3-5</ref>. </char></note> boona baagira enaama y'okuza kurwanisa Yerusaalemu, n'okugirabanisamu. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:38">Mak 14:38</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka itwe twashaba Ruhanga waitu, twataho abarinzi b'okurinda nyomushana na nyekiro.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwombeka beeteekateekire kurwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Bwanyima Abayuda baagira bati: Abarikwekorera baahwa amaani, kandi ebisheenyuka bikiri bingi; n'ahabw'ekyo titurikubaasa kwombeka rugo. <verse eid="NEH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Abazigu baitu baagira bati: Tibarikwija kukimanya, n'obu kwakuba okutureeba, okuhitsya obu turaabahikye ahagati, tukabaita, tukabazibira kukora. <verse eid="NEH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Abayudaaya abaabaire batwire n'abo bazigu baitu ku baizire, baaguma nibatugambira, nangwa baahitsya emirundi ikumi, nibagira ngu abo bazigu nibaija kuruga hoonahoona ahu batwire, batuteere. <verse eid="NEH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Nikyo naateereire abantu omu buhanga enyima y'orugo, n'aha mitwe y'obubungo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri, baine zaarurara n'amacumu n'amata. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:29">Bir 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:21">7:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">10:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 10:12">2 Sam 10:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku naayetegyereize, naimuka, naagambira abakungu n'abatware n'abandi boona nti: Mutabatiina. Mwijukye Mukama, omukuru kandi orikutiinisa, murwanirire beene waanyu, batabani baanyu, bahara baanyu, abakazi baanyu n'amaka gaanyu.<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:12">Yob 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abazigu baitu ku baahuriire ngu tukimanyire, kandi ngu Ruhanga acwire busha enaama yaabo, twena twagaruka aha rugo, buri muntu aha murimo gwe. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Okuruga ahari eryo izooba, ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri ky'abashaija bangye kyaguma aha murimo gw'okwombeka, kimwe kya kabiri ekindi kyakwata amacumu, engabo, amata n'ebijwaro by'ebyoma eby'okurwanisa; kandi abeebembezi baayemerera enyima y'ab'enju ya Yuda boona. <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Abaabaire nibombeka orugo, n'abaabaire nibeekorera ebintu, buri muntu akaba akoresa omukono gumwe, ogundi guguma gukwaitse eby'okurwanisa. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Buri mwombeki weena akaba ayombeka, ahagatiire rurara ye; kandi ow'okuteera eikondere anguma aha rubaju. <verse eid="NEH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Kandi naagambira abakungu n'abatware n'abandi boona nti: Omurimo ni muhango, guhikire hare, kandi itwe twenaganagire aha rugo, buri muntu ari hare na mugyenzi we. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:14">Kur 14:14</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:30">Bir 1:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:22">3:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:10">Yos 23:10</ref>. </char></note> Ei muraahurire eiraka ry'enzamba yoona, mube niyo mwairukira, mutushangye. Ruhanga waitu naija kuturwanirira. <verse eid="NEH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Okwo nikwo twabaire tukora omurimo, ekicweka kyabo kimwe kikwata amacumu, okwiha omu kasheeshe nibutaagurikana okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, ahu enyonyoozi zireebekyera. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Omuri obwo bunaku naagaruka naagambira abantu nti: Buri muntu n'omuhuuku we bagume baraare omuri Yerusaalemu, babone kuturinda nyekiro, n'okukora nyomushana. <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo tihariho n'omwe omuriitwe owaabaire ajuura ebijwaro bye, yaaba nyowe, nari beene tata, nari abashaija bangye, n'obu baakuba abarinzi abaabaire bangyenda enyima; buri muntu akaba aza kutaha amaizi, aine eky'okurwanisa kye omu ngaro.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Abamwe aha Bayudaaya okwetomboitera beene waabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lev 25:35</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 25:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:7">Bir 15:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima bamwe aha Bayudaaya n'abakazi baabo baayetomboitera beene waabo Abayudaaya; <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />ahakuba abamwe bakagira bati: Itwe n'abatabani baitu na bahara baitu turi baingi; ka tuze kushaka eby'okututunga. <verse eid="NEH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Kandi abandi baagira bati: Nitukwatiriza emisiri yaitu, n'emizaabibu yaitu, n'amaju gaitu, ahabw'enjara, ngu tubone eby'okurya. <verse eid="NEH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:13">Ezr 4:13</ref>. </char></note> N'abandi baagira bati: Tugurize empiiha, twakwatiriza emisiri yaitu n'emizaabibu yaitu kuha omushoro gw'omugabe. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:7">Kur 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:1">2 Bag 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Haza itwe na beene waitu turi omubiri gumwe, n'abaana baitu nikyo kimwe n'abaabo; mbwenu batabani baitu na bahara baitu nitubagyema kuba abahuuku n'abazaana; nangwa n'abamwe ahari bahara baitu babeereire kimwe abazaana, kandi titwine ky'okukora, ngu tubacungure, ahabw'okuba emisiri yaitu n'emizaabibu yaitu biinwe abandi.<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Ku naahuriire okwetomboita kwabo n'ebigambo ebyo, naagira ekiniga kingi munonga. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Kur 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36">Lev 25:36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 15:5">Zab 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:12">Ezk 22:12</ref>. </char></note> Naagira enaama n'omutima gwangye, bwanyima naatonganisa abakungu n'abatware, naabagira nti: Nimwiha ahari beene waanyu ekiteebwamu, buri muntu ahari mwene waabo. <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:48">Lev 25:48</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 25:49">49</ref>. </char></note> Naateerana omutwe gw'abantu baingi kukibeemeza, naabagira nti: Itwe tukakora eki turikubaasa, twacungura beene waitu Abayudaaya, abaabaire baguzirwe abanyamahanga; mbwenu imwe nimwenda kutunda beene waanyu; nimugira ngu, kihikire itwe kubagura? Baahunama, baabura eky'okugarukamu. <verse eid="NEH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:36">Lev 25:36</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:4">Neh 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Naagaruka naagira nti: Eki murikukora ti kirungi. Ekirungi t'okugyendera omu kutiina Ruhanga waitu, mukareka kwejumisa omu banyamahanga abazigu baitu? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Kandi nyowe na beene waitu n'abashaija bangye nitubaguza empiiha n'eby'okurya; kwonka ka turekye kubashaba ekiteebwamu. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Na mbwenu eri izooba mubagarurire emisiri yaabo, emizaabibu yaabo, emizeituuni yaabo, n'amaju gaabo, kandi tubagarurire na kimwe kya igana eky'empiiha, engano, viinyo n'eky'amajuta, ebi mubaire nimubahaisa. <verse eid="NEH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:31">Neh 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:8">Yer 34:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Baagarukamu nibagira bati: Twaza kubibagarurira, kandi titurikwija kugira ki twabahaisa. Nitwija kukora nk'oku waagamba. Ntyo naayeta abanyamurwa, naabarahiriza omu maisho g'abo bantu kuguma nibakora nk'oku baarahira. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:6">Neh 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:48">Zab 106:48</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">Byak 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:36">1 Bus 16:36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naakunkumura omunagiro ogu naabaire nnagiire, naagira nti: Omuntu weena, oraabe atahikiriize egi ndagaano, Ruhanga amukunkumure atyo, amwihe omu nju ye n'omu murimo gwe. Abe nikwo yaakunkumurwa atyo, akahwaho. Omutwe gw'abantu abaabaire bateeraine baagira bati: Amiina, baahimbisa MUKAMA. Bwanyima abantu baakora nk'oku baaraganisa.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku Nehemia yaategyekire abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:1">Neh 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:6">13:6</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:8">2 Tes 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi okuruga omu bunaku obu naatandikiiremu kuba omutegyeki w'abantu omuri Yuda, okwiha aha mwaka gwa makumi abiri okuhitsya aha gwa makumi ashatu n'ebiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Aruta-gizakiseesi, omuri egyo myaka ikumi n'ebiri, nyowe na beene tata titurariire ha by'okurya by'emitoijo y'obutegyeki. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Kwonka abategyeki abambandiize bakaita kubi abantu, nibabatoijesa eby'okurya na viinyo, otabariireho shekeli z'efeeza makumi ana. Nangwa n'abagaragwa baabo bakaba batwaza abantu eikama. Kwonka nyowe tindatwarize ntyo ahabw'okutiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Kureka nkaba nyezirika kukora hari orwo rugo, kandi tihariho itaka ryona eri naatwaire; n'abashaija bangye boona bakaba bateeranirayo, bareetsirwe ogwo murimo. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7">2 Sam 9:7</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 9:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha meeza yangye hakaba hariiraho abashaija igana na makumi ataano, Abayudaaya n'abatware, otabariireho abaabaire baija ahariitwe, nibaruga omu mahanga agatwehinguririize. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:22">1 Bag 4:22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 4:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Ebago y'eizooba rimwe ekaba eba ente emwe, n'entaama mukaaga ezitoorainwe; banteekyera n'enkoko, kandi buri biro ikumi efurebe za viinyo y'emiringo mingi; kwonka ebyo byona nkaba ntabitoijesa bantu nk'omutegyeki; ahabw'okuba obuhuuku bukaba bubaruhize. <verse eid="NEH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:14">Neh 13:14</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga wangye, oijukye ebi naakoreire aba bantu byona, onzimuurire ebirungi.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abazigu okwenda okuzibira omurimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:19">Neh 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:1">3:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 3:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:7">4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro, baagambira Sanibalati na Tobia na Geshemu Omuharabu n'abandi bazigu baitu, ku nyombekire orugo, kandi ku hatakiriho hasheenyukire, (n'obu ndaabe naabaire ntakataire nyigi mu marembo.) <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu, ku baakihuriire bantumaho nigabira bati: Ija tubugaabuganire omu kirorero kimwe omu ruhita rwa Ono. Kwonka bakaba nibenda kuunyita. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Naanye nikwo kubatumaho entumwa, nkabagira nti: Ndi aha murimo muhango; tindikubaasa kushuuma okwo. Mbwenu omurimo gwemerere ngu nyizire okwo? <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Bantumaho batyo kana, naanye nimbagarukamu ntyo. <verse eid="NEH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Bwanyima Sanibalati yaagaruka yantumaho omuheereza we omurundi gwa kataano omu muringo ogwo, aine ebaruha eshashaanire omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:2">Luk 23:2</ref>. </char></note> Egyo baruha ekaba ehandiikirwemu ebigambo ebirikugira biti: Nikigambwa omu mahanga, kandi na Geshemu naakigamba, ngu iwe n'Abayudaaya nimwenda kugoma; ngu nikyo murikwombekyera orugo; kandi ngu, nooyenda kuba omugabe waabo, nk'oku kirikugambwa. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Kandi ngu, otaireho na baanabi b'okubuzya ebyawe omuri Yerusaalemu, ngu, Omuri Yuda harimu omugabe. Mbwenu oije tuhanuure, ahabw'okuba ebyo bigambo tibiribura kugambirwa mugabe. <verse eid="NEH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Naanye naamutumaho, nimmugira nti: Ebyo ebi waagamba tibikabahoga; kureka niiwe waabyegunzira omu mutima gwawe. <verse eid="NEH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Boona bakaba nibagira batyo, ngu batutiinise, nibateekateeka ngu emikono yaitu neija kutentebuka, omurimo nigureka kukorwa. Kwonka ai Ruhanga, gumya emikono yangye.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 36:5">Yer 36:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naaza owa Shemaaya mwene Delaaya, mwijukuru wa Mehetabeeli, owaabaire akomirwe; yangira ati: Ija tubugaabuganire omu nju ya Ruhanga omuri hekalu, tukingye enyigi zaayo; ahabw'okuba nibaija kukwita, eego, nibaija kukwita nyekiro. <verse eid="NEH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Naamugarukamu nti: Omushaija nkaanye nimbaasa kuhunga? Ni mushaija ki nkaanye orikubaasa kuhungira omuri hekalu, ngu akire? Tindikuzamu. <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12, 14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:17">Ezk 13:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku naayetegyereize, naamanya ku atatumirwe Ruhanga, kureka ku yandaguraho atyo, ahabw'okuguriirirwa Tobia na Sanibalati. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Eki baamuguriririire, bakenda ngu antiinise, haza naanye nkore ntyo, nshiishe, ekiraarugyemu bangambeho kubi, banshekyerere. <verse eid="NEH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:29">Neh 13:29</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga wangye, ijuka Tobia na Sanibalati, n'ebyo byona ebi barikukora, oijukye na nabikazi Noadia, na baanabi abandi boona, ababaire nibenda kuntiinisa.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhwa kw'orugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Rutyo orugo rwahwa aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bitaano ky'okwezi Eluli omu biro makumi ataano na bibiri. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 4:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 126:2">Zab 126:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 127:1">127:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abazigu baitu boona ku baakihuriire, n'amahanga goona agatwehinguririize gaakireeba, baatiina, baahwera kimwe eishaija, ahabw'okuba bakareeba ngu ogwo murimo gukozirwe ahabw'okuhwerwa Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="NEH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Kandi omu biro ebyo abakungu b'Abayudaaya bakatwekyera Tobia ebaruha nyingi, n'eza Tobia zaabahikaho. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Ahabw'okuba baingi omuri Yuda bakaragaana nawe endagaano ahabw'okuba mukwe wa Shekania mwene Aara, kandi n'omutabani Yehohanani akaba ashweire muhara wa Meshulaamu mwene Berekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Kandi baagambira omu maisho gangye ebirungi ebi akora, baagaruka baamugambira n'ebigambo byangye. Atyo Tobia yaaguma nantwekyera ebaruha z'okuntiinisa.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 6:1">Neh 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima orugo ku rwahweire, naaheza kutaho enyigi, n'okutaho abakumiirizi, abeeshongozi n'Abaleevi, <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:2">Neh 1:2</ref>. </char></note> naaha mwene tata Hanani na Hanania omukuru w'ekigo obukuru bw'okutegyeka Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba akaba ari omuntu orikwesigwa kandi orikutiina Ruhanga okukira abandi baingi. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Bwanyima naabagira nti: Enyigi za Yerusaalemu zigume zirekye kwigurwa, omushana gutakajwire; bagume bazikingye, abarinzi bakyemereireho, baziteho empimbi; kandi mugume muteho abarinzi b'omu bantu ba Yerusaalemu, buri muntu mumute omu mwanya gwe, aharikureebana n'enju ye. <verse eid="NEH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Orurembo rukaba ruri ruhango kandi rugarami, kwonka abantu baamwo bakaba bari bakye, n'amaju gaarwo gatakombekirwe.<verse eid="NEH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'abaarugire omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 1:11">Ezr 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Ruhanga wangye yantamu ekiteekateeko ky'okuteerana abakungu n'abategyeki n'abandi bantu, ngu babarwe nk'okukuratana kw'oruzaaro rwabo oku kwabairie kuri. Naazoora ekitabo ekirimu abaabandize kwija, nk'okukuratana kw'oruzaaro oku kwabaire kuri; kandi naashanga kihandiikirwemu kiti:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-73: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:1-3:1">Ezr 2:1—3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba nibo bantu b'eryo ihanga abaarugire omu bantu, abu Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaatwaire bari enkwatwa, bakagaruka Yerusaalemu na Yuda, buri muntu omu rurembo rwabo. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Bakaija na Zerubabeeli, Yeshua, Nehemia, Azaria, Raamia, Nahamaani, Morodekai, Bilushaani, Biguvai, Nehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Omubaro gw'abashaija b'Abaisraeli nigwo ogu: <verse eid="NEH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8-42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:14-27">Neh 10:14-27</ref>. </char></note> beene Paroshi enkumi ibiri na igana na makumi mushanju na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Beene Shefatia, magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Beene Aara, magana mukaaga na makumi ataano na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Beene Pehasi-moabu, nibo beene Yeshua na Yoabu, enkumi ibiri na magana munaana na ikumi na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:34">Neh 7:34</ref>. </char></note> Beene Elamu, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ataano na bana. <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Beene Zaatu, magana munaana na makumi ana na bataano. <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Beene Zekai, magana mushanju na makumi mukaaga. <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Beene Binui, magana mukaaga na makumi ana na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Beene Bebai, magana mukaaga na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Beene Azigaadi, enkumi ibiri na magana ashatu na makumi abiri na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Beene Adoni-kaamu, magana mukaaga na makumi mukaaga na mushanju. <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Beene Viguvai, enkumi ibiri na makumi mukaaga na mushanju. <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Beene Adini, magana mukaaga na makumi ataano na bataano. <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Beene Ateeri, nibo ba Hezekia, makumi mwenda na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Beene Hashumu, magana ashatu na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Beene Bezai, magana ashatu na makumi abiri na bana. <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Beene Harifu, igana na ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Beene Gibeoni, makumi mwenda na bataano. <verse eid="NEH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Abashaija ba Betelehemu na Netofa, igana na makumi munaana na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Abashaija ba Anatoosi, igana na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Abashaija ba Besi-azimaveesi, makumi ana na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Abashaija ba Kirayasi-yarimu, Kefira na Beeroosi, magana mushanju na makumi ana na bashatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Abashaija ba Raama na Geeba, magana mukaaga na makumi abiri n'omwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Beene Mikimaasi, igana na makumi abiri na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Abashaija ba Beseeli na Ai, igana na makumi abiri na bashatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Abashaija ba Neebo endiijo, makumi ataano na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:12">Neh 7:12</ref>. </char></note> Beene Elaamu ondiijo, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ataano na bana. <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Beene Harimu, magana ashatu na makumi abiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Beene Yeriko magana ashatu na makumi ana na bataano. <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Beene Loodi, Hadidi na Ono, magana mushanju na makumi abiri n'omwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Beene Senaha, enkumi ishatu na magana mwenda na makumi ashatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:10">1 Bus 9:10</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:7">24:7</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa n'aba: beene Yedaaya ab'omu nju ya Yeshua, magana mwenda na makumi mushanju na bashatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:12">1 Bus 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:14">24:14</ref>. </char></note> Beene Imeri, rukumi na magana ataano na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:12">1 Bus 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Beene Pashihuuri, rukumi na magana abiri na makumi ana na mushanju. <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Beene Harimu, rukumi na ikumi na mushanju.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:40">Ezr 2:40</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:9">3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaleevi n'aba: beene Yeshua ba Kadimieli ow'omuri beene Hodeva, makumi mushanju na bana. <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Abeeshongozi beene Asafu, igana na makumi ana na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Abakumiirizi: beene Shalumu, beene Ateeri, beene Talumooni, beene Akubu, beene Hatita na beene Shobai, igana na makumi ashatu na munaana.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Abaheereza b'omuri hekalu bakaba bari aba: beene Ziiha, beene Hasufa, beene Tabaosi, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />beene Kerosi, beene Siaha, beene Padoni, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />beene Lebana, beene Hagaba, beene Shalumai, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />beene Hanani, beene Gideli, beene Gahaari, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />beene Reaya, beene Rezini, beene Nekoda, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />beene Gazamu, beene Uzza, beene Pasea, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />beene Besai, beene Meunimu, beene Nefushesimu, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />beene Bakibuki, beene Hakufa, beene Harihuri, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />beene Baziluusi, beene Mehida, beene Harisha, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />beene Barikoosi, beene Sisera, beene Teema, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />beene Nezia, na beene Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Batabani b'abagaragwa ba Sulemaani: beene Sotai, beene Soferesi, beene Perida, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />beene Yaala, beene Darikoni, beene Gideli, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />beene Shefatia, beene Hatili, beene Pokeresi-hazebaimu, na beene Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Abaheereza b'omuri hekalu boona n'abatabani b'abagaragwa ba Sulemaani bakaba bari magana ashatu na makumi mwenda na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Kandi aba nibo baarugire Telimeela, Teliharasha, Kerubu, Adoni na Imeri, kwonka tibarabaasize kworeka maju ga baishenkurubo, nari obukomooko bwabo, kuhamya ku bari Abaisraeli buzima; <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />beene Delaaya, beene Tobia, na beene Nekoda, magana mukaaga na makumi ana na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Kandi ab'omu banyamurwa; beene Hobaaya, beene Hakozi, na beene Baruzilai, owaashweire omukazi ow'omuri bahara ba Baruzilai owa Gileadi, akeetererwa eiziina ryabo. <verse eid="NEH 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Abo bakasherura amaziina gaabo omu baahandiikirwe nk'okukuratana kw'oruzaaro rwa baishenkurubo oku kwabaire kuri, kwonka tigaareebekamu; nikyo baateekateekyeirwe kuba abatashemeire, bakazibirwa kukora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa; <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:65, 70: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:9">Neh 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:1">10:1</ref>. </char></note> omutegyeki omukuru yaabaragiira ngu barekye kurya aha by'okurya ebirikwera, okuhitsya obu haribaho omunyamurwa oine Urimu na Tumimu.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Omutwe gw'abo bantu boona gukaba guri obukumi buna n'enkumi ibiri na magana ashatu na makumi mukaaga, <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />otabariiremu abahuuku baabo n'abazaana baabo, abu omubaro gwabo gwabaire guri enkumi mushanju na magana ashatu na makumi ashatu na mushanju; kandi bakaba baine abeeshongozi, abashaija n'abakazi, magana abiri na makumi ana na bataano. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Embaraasi zaabo zikaba ziri magana mushanju na makumi ashatu na mukaaga, enyumbu magana abiri na makumi ana na itaano, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />engamira magana ana na makumi ashatu na itaano, n'endogoya enkumi mukaaga na magana mushanju na makumi abiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Kandi bamwe ab'omu bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo baahayo eby'okuhwera omurimo. Omutegyeki yaata omu ibiikiro dariki z'ezaabu rukumi, enyabya makumi ataano, n'ebijwaro by'abanyamurwa magana ataano na makumi ashatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />N'abamwe ab'omu bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo baata omu ibiikiro ry'empiiha z'omurimo dariki z'ezaabu obukumi bubiri, na miina z'efeeza enkumi ibiri na magana abiri. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Ebi abandi bantu baahaireyo bikaba biri dariki z'ezaabu obukumi bubiri, miina z'efeeza enkumi ibiri, n'ebijwaro by'abanyamurwa makumi mukaaga na mushanju.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Batyo abanyamurwa, Abaleevi, abakumiriizi, abeeshongozi, abamwe omu bantu, abaheereza b'omuri hekalu, n'Abaisraeli boona, baatuura omu ndembo zaabo. Okwezi kwa mushanju ku kwahikire, Abaisraeli baashangwa batwire omu ndembo zaabo.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ezera okushomera abantu Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 3:26">Neh 3:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:6">Ezr 7:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu baateeranira hamwe nk'omuntu omwe omu kibuga ekiri omu maisho g'eirembo ry'Amaizi, baagambira Ezera omuhandiiki kureeta ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya Musa, ebi Ruhanga yaahaire Abaisraeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:11">Bir 31:11</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'okwezi kwa mushanju Ezera omunyamurwa yaareeta ekyo kitabo ky'Ebiragiro omu maisho g'omutwe gw'abashaija n'abakazi, boona abaabaire nibabaasa kuhurira, bakeetegyereza. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Yaashoma ebirimu, ayorekyeire ekibuga ekiri omu maisho g'eirembo ry'Amaizi, okwiha omu kasheeshe kare okuhitsya omu ihangwe, abashaija n'abakazi n'abandi abarikubaasa kwetegyereza bariho; kandi abantu boona baatega amatu kuhurira eby'omuri ekyo kitabo ky'Ebiragiro. <verse eid="NEH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Kandi Ezera omuhandiiki yaayemerera aha kituuti ky'embaaho, eki baabaire bakozire ahabw'ogwo murimo; aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo haayemereraho Matisia, Sheema, Anaya, Uriya, Hilukia na Maaseya; n'aha rwa bumosho, Pedaaya, Mishaeli, Malikiya, Hashumu, Hashibadana, Zekaria na Meshulaamu. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Atyo Ezera yaashuuruurira ekitabo omu maisho g'abantu boona, ahakuba akaba ari ahatunguukire naabeeshumba; ku yaakishuurwire, abantu boona baayemerera. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:13">Neh 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:18">2 Bus 20:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 134:2">Zab 134:2</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:41">Tonz 3:41</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:8">1 Tim 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Ezera yaasiima MUKAMA Ruhanga omukuru, n'abantu boona baikiriza nibaimutsya emikono yaabo, nibagira bati: Amiina, Amiina; bainika emitwe yaabo, baaramya MUKAMA bajuumaire ahansi. <verse eid="NEH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7, 8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:3">2 Bus 35:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yeshua, Baani, Sherebia, Yamiina, Akubu, Shabetai, Hodia, Maaseya, Kelita, Azaria, Yozabaadi, Hanani, Pelaaya, Abaleevi, baahwera abantu kwetegyereza Ebiragiro; obwo abantu boona bari omu myanya yaabo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:3">Neh 9:3</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 9:4">4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:30">Byak 8:30</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 8:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Baashoma omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya Ruhanga omu iraka eririkuhurirwa gye, baabishoboorora; n'ahabw'ekyo abantu baayetegyereza ebyashomwa.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 12:26">Neh 12:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:63">Ezr 2:63</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:1">Kub 29:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Nehemia, owaabaire ari omutegyeki, na Ezera omunyamurwa kandi omuhandiiki, n'Abaleevi abaabaire nibeegyesa abantu, baagambira abantu boona bati: Eizooba eri n'eririkwera ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; murekye kuganya, nari kurira. Ahabw'okuba abantu boona ku baahuriire ebigambo by'Ebiragiro, baarira. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10, 12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:19">Est 9:19</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaabagira ati: Mwirooko murye ez'ebishaju, munywe ebirikunuriirira, mutwekyere abataine obabisiire egabo; ahakuba eri izooba n'eryereziibwe Mukama waitu; kandi murekye kushaasha, ahabw'okuba okushemerererwa omuri MUKAMA nigo maani gaanyu. <verse eid="NEH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Batyo Abaalevi baahunamya abantu boona nibagira bati: Mucureere, ahakuba eizooba eri n'eririkwera; murekye kushaasha. <verse eid="NEH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Bwanyima abantu boona baayaabuuka, baaza kurya n'okunywa kandi n'okutwekyera bagyenzi baabo egabo, n'okushemererwa munonga, ahabw'okushoborokyerwa ebigambo ebi baagambirwa.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugaruraho obugyenyi bw'Ensiisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Aha kiro kya kabiri abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru ab'eihanga ryona, hamwe n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, baateeranira ahari Ezera omuhandiiki kuhurira ebigambo by'omu Biragiro. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:40">40</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:42">42</ref>. </char></note> Baashanga bihandiikirwe omu Biragiro, ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire naaraba omuri Musa, ngu Abaisraeli baryaguma nibaraara omu nsiisira omu bugyenyi bw'okwezi kwa mushanju, <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:16">Bir 16:16</ref>. </char></note> kandi baryaguma babirangye, babibuzye omu ndembo zaabo zoona n'omuri Yerusaalemu, nibagira bati: Mwirooko muze omu bibungo, mureete amataagi g'emizeituuni, n'ag'emizeituuni ey'omu ishwa, n'ag'emikadasi, n'ag'emikindo, n'ag'ebiti by'amababi gashakambire, mukore ensiisira, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe. <verse eid="NEH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Batyo abantu baagyenda, baareeta amataagi, baayeyombekyera ensiisira, buri muntu aha mutwe gw'enju ye, n'omu bibuga byabo, n'omu bikaari by'enju ya Ruhanga, n'omu kibuga ky'aha Irembo ry'Amaizi, kandi n'omu kibuga ky'aha irembo rya Efuraimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:2">1 Bag 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:4">Ezr 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Omutwe gwona ogw'abaarugire omu bukwatwa baayombeka ensiisira, baaziraaramu; ahakuba okwiha omu biro bya Yoshua mwene Nuuni okuhitsya ahari eryo izooba Abaisraeli bakaba batakakitwazaga batyo. Haabaho okushemererwa kwingi munonga. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:35">Kub 29:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:10">Bir 31:10</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okwiha aha kiro ky'okubanza okuhitsya aha ky'aha muheru, Ezera akaba ashoma ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya Ruhanga buri izooba. Batyo baamara ebiro mushanju omuri obwo bugyenyi; aha kya munaana haabaho okuteerana okurikwera, nk'oku ekiragiro kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abantu okwesiibyakwo n'okweteisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 7:6">Yos 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:12">1 Sam 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 3:31">2 Sam 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:2">Neh 8:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina ky'okwo kwezi Abaisraeli baateerana, baayesiibyakwo bajwaire ebiguniya, beeshukyeire eiju omu mutwe. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:28">Neh 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:3">13:3</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:21">Ezr 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:11">10:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaisraeli baayetaanisa n'abanyamahanga boona, baayemerera, baayatura ebibi byabo, n'eby'okushisha bya baishenkurubo. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3, 4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:7">Neh 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 8:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Baayemerera omu mwanya gwabo, baamara ekicweka kimwe kya kana ky'eizooba nibashoma ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo; kandi ekindi kicweka kimwe kya kana baakimara nibaatura ebibi byabo, nibaramya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Bwanyima Yeshua, Baani, Kadimieli, Shebania, Buuni, Sherebia, Baani na Kenani, baayemerera aha matembero g'Abaleevi, baatakira MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo n'eiraka rihango. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:13">1 Bus 29:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abaleevi, Yeshua, Kadimieli, Baani, Hashabuneya, Sherebia, Hodia, Shebania na Pesahia, baagira bati: Mwimukye, musiime MUKAMA, oba Ruhanga waanyu okwiha ira ryona okuhitsya ebiro byona, nimugira muti: Eiziina ryawe ery'ekitiinisa, eririkukira okusiimwa kwona n'okusingizibwa kwona, rihimbisibwe.<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Kut 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:4">Bir 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:14">10:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:15">2 Bag 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:6">Zab 36:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:6">Kush 10:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Ezera yaagira ati: niiwe MUKAMA, niiwe wenka, owaahangire eiguru n'eiguru eririkweshumba agandi, n'eihe ryaryo ryona, ensi n'ebigirimu byona, n'amayanja n'ebigarimu byona; kandi niiwe obibaisaho byona; n'amahe g'omu iguru goona gakuramya. <verse eid="NEH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Kut 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:5">17:5</ref>. </char></note> Niiwe MUKAMA, Ruhanga owaatooraine Abramu, okamwiha omuri Uuri ey'Abakaludaaya, okamweta eiziina Abrahamu; <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Kut 15:6</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">18-21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:7-9">17:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:14">Yos 23:14</ref>. </char></note> okashanga aine omutima ogurikwesigwa omu maisho gaawe, okaragaana nawe endagaano y'okuha abaijukuru ensi y'Abanyakanaani, ey'Abahiiti, ey'Abaamori, ey'Abaperizi, ey'Abayebusi n'ey'Abagirugashi; kandi ebyo ebi waaraganiise okabihikiiriza, ahabw'okuba ori ohikiriire. <verse eid="NEH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:10">14:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima waareeba okubonabonesibwa kwa baatatenkuriitwe bari Misri, waahurira okutaka kwabo bari aha Nyanja erikutukura, <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:2-6">Kur 7:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 9:16">9:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:11">18:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:12">Isa 63:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 63:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:20">Yer 32:20</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:15">Dan 9:15</ref>. </char></note> waayoreka obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza ebi waakozire ahari Faraho n'abagaragwa be n'abantu b'omu nsi ye boona; ahabw'okuba okamanya oku baagizire baatatenkuriitwe n'amaryo; ekyarugiremu waayetungira eiziina rugambwa, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:27">27</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:5">15:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 15:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:13">Zab 74:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:13">78:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima waataanisamu enyanja habiri omu maisho gaabo, baaraba ahagati yaayo hoomire, kwonka abaabaire babakuratiire waabanaga ahagati y'amaizi, baatobera omu maizi maingi nk'eibaare. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Kur 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:14">Kub 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:1">1 Kor 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyomushana okaba obeebembera n'enyomyo y'ekicu, na nyekiro obeebembera n'enyomyo y'omuriro, kubamurikira omuhanda ogu bashemereire kutoora. <verse eid="NEH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:20">Kur 19:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">20:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 19:8">Zab 19:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 19:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 7:19">Rom 7:19</ref>. </char></note> Okashuuma aha rushozi Sinai, waagamba nabo nooyema omu iguru, waabateeraho emigyenzo ehikire n'ebiragiro by'amazima, ebyatairweho ebirungi, n'ebyaragiirwe; <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Kut 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 2:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:23">Kur 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">20:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:13-17">31:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:12">Ezk 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:20">20</ref>. </char></note> waabamanyisa sabato yaawe erikwera, waabaragiira nooraba omu mwiru waawe Musa ebiragiro n'ebyatairweho, byaba ebiragiro byawe. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:14">Kur 16:14</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:6">17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:10">Kub 20:10</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 20:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:8">Bir 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:15-16">Zab 78:15-16</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:40">105:40</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 105:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:31">Yoh 6:31</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:3">1 Kor 10:3</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 10:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ku baagizire enjara, waabaha eby'okurya ebirikuruga omu iguru; ku baagizire eiriho, waabaihira amaizi omu rukiri, waabaragiira kuza omu nsi ei waarahiire kubaha, ngu bagikubuure.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:16, 17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:27">Bir 31:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bo na baatatenkuriitwe baagira amaryo, baagangaaza ebitsya byabo, tibaayorobera biragiro byawe, <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kur 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:4">Kub 14:4</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 14:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:31">Neh 9:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:11">Zab 78:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:42">42</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:43">43</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:5">86:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 86:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:13">Yoel 2:13</ref>. </char></note> baayanga kuhurira, kandi tibaijuka by'okutangaaza, ebi waakoreire omuribo; kureka baagangaaza ebitsya byabo, kandi ahabw'obugomi bwabo baayeteeraho omwebembezi, ngu bagarukye Misri omu buhuuku bwabo. Kwonka Iwe ori Ruhanga oyeteekateekire kusaasira, oine embabazi n'esaasi, otarahuka kuguubwa kubi, kureka ogira okukunda okutaruga ha rugyero; torabarekire. <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Kur 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:26">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:41">Zab 78:41</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:58">58</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:19">106:19</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:41">Byak 7:41</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa n'obu baayeheeshera ekishushani ky'enyana bakagira bati: Ogu niwe Ruhanga waanyu, owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, bakakora ebirikukugwisa kubi ebirengyesereize, <verse eid="NEH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:45">Zab 106:45</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Iwe ahabw'embabazi zaawe nyingi torabatsigireho bari omu ihamba; enyomyo y'ekicu ey'okubeebembera omu muhanda nyomushana ekaba etabaruga mu maisho, n'obu yaakuba ey'omuriro kubamurikira nyekiro kubooreka ei baraatoore. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kur 16:35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:17">Kub 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:11">Isa 63:11</ref>. </char></note> Waabaha Omwoyo waawe omurungi kubeegyesa, kandi tiwaabaima maanu yaawe kubura eky'okurya, waabaha amaizi kubatambira eiriho. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7">Bir 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:4">8:4</ref>. </char></note> Waabatungira omu ihamba okumara emyaka makumi ana, tibaagira ki baakyena; ebijwaro byabo tibyakura, n'ebigyere byabo tibyazimba. <verse eid="NEH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-31">Kub 21:21-31</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:35">33:35</ref>. </char></note> Waabaha ensi z'abagabe, n'amahanga nk'oku emigabo yaabo yaabaire eri; batyo baakubuura ensi ya Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni, n'eya Ogi omugabe wa Bashani. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Kut 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:10">Bir 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Waakanyisa oruzaaro rwabo, rwaba nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, waabahitsya omu nsi, ei waagambiire baishenkurubo ku barigizamu, bakagikubuura. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:2">Zab 44:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 44:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baijukuru baabo baaza omuri egyo nsi, baagikubuura; Abanyakanaani abatuuzi b'omuri egyo nsi, waabasingurira omu maisho gaabo, waabahayo omu mikono yaabo hamwe n'abagabe baabo n'abantu baamwo, kubagira nk'oku barikwenda. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:27">Kub 13:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:5">Bir 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:11">6:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:7">8:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:12">Yos 14:12</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:35">Neh 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:6">Ezk 20:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baakwata endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, n'ensi ezirikweza munonga, baakubuura amaju agaijwire ebintu byona ebirungi, n'amaziba agafukwire, n'emisiri y'emizaabibu n'ey'emizeituuni n'ey'ebiti bingi ebirikwana ebijuma; batyo baarya, baahaaga, baagomoka, baashemerererwa omu burungi bwawe bwingi.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:11">Bar 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 2:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:9">1 Bag 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:4">18:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Bus 24:20</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:17">Zab 50:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:21">Ezk 20:21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Byak 7:52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka baayanga kukuhurira, baakugomera, ebiragiro byawe baabyenaga enyima, baita baanabi baawe, abaabaire babateisa ngu bakugarukire, baakora ebirikukugwisa kubi ebirengyesereize. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:14">Bar 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 2:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:41">Zab 106:41</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:42">42</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:45">45</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo waabaheereireyo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo, bakabaita kubi; kwonka omu biro by'obusaasi bakaba bakutakira, obahurira oyemi omu iguru, kandi nk'oku embabazi zaawe ziba nyingi, obaha ab'okubajuna, babaiha omu mikono y'abazigu baabo. <verse eid="NEH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:11">Bar 3:11</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 3:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:43">Zab 106:43</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku baabaire bamara ebiro baagira obusingye, bagaruka bakora ebi orikwanga; nikyo waabaire obarekyera omu mikono y'abazigu baabo, bakabatwara; kwonka ku baabaire bahinduka, baakutakira, obahurira oyemi omu iguru, emirundi mingi obajuna, nk'oku embabazi zaawe ziri. <verse eid="NEH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:21">Ezk 20:21</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:11">Zek 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:17">Mat 19:17</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:12">Gal 3:12</ref>. </char></note> Okaba obateisa, ngu obone kubagarura, boorobere ebiragiro byawe. Kwonka bagira amaryo, banga kubyorobera, bashiisha ebiragiro ebi waaragiire, haza biri ebi omuntu yaakukozire, bikamubaisaho, batunika amabega gaabo, bagangaaza ebitsya, banga kuhurira. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13">2 Bag 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:7">Ezr 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Obagumisiririza emyaka mingi, obateisa n'Omwoyo waawe noogambira omuri baanabi baawe; kwonka banga kutega amatu kuhurira. Nikyo waabaire obaheerayo omu mikono y'amahanga g'omu nsi ezo. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:18">Yer 5:18</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, torabamariireho kimwe ahabw'embabazi zaawe, kandi torabatsigireho; ahabw'okuba ori Ruhanga ow'embabazi n'okusaasira.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:21">Bir 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3">2 Bag 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:5">Neh 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, ai Ruhanga waitu, Ruhanga Nyamuhanga ow'amaani kandi orikutiinwa, otaita ndagaano, kandi ow'okukunda okutaruga ha rugyero, noomanya enaku zoona ezi twareebire, itwe n'abagabe baitu, abanyiginya baitu, abanyamurwa baitu, baanabi baitu, baatatenkuriitwe, n'abantu baawe boona, okwiha omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Asiria n'okuhitsya hati, ezo naku orekye kuzeeta busha. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:15">Ezr 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:6">Zab 106:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:5">Dan 9:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omuri ebyo byona ebyatubaireho, okaguma ori ow'amazima; ahakuba Iwe okakora eby'obwesigwa, haza itwe twakora kubi. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Abagabe baitu, abanyiginya baitu, abanyamurwa baitu, na baatatenkuriitwe tibaroorobeire biragiro byawe, n'obu kwakuba okweta aha bi waaragiire n'ebi waabaire obateisa. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Ku baabaire bari omu bugabe bwabo, omu birungi bingi ebi waabahaire, n'omu nsi mpango kandi erikweza munonga, ei waataire omu maisho gaabo, tibaragikuheerereizemu, kandi tibararekire micwe yaabo emibi. <verse eid="NEH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:9">Ezr 9:9</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu reeba, turi abahuuku na hati; turi abahuuku omu nsi ei waahaire baatatenkuriitwe kurya ebijuma byamwo n'ebirungi byamwo byona. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:33">Bir 28:33</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:51">51</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka yaamwo etungisa munonga abagabe abu waataireho kututegyeka ahabw'ebibi byaitu; kandi abo bagabe baine obushoboorozi aha mibiri yaitu n'aha matungo gaitu, kubikora nk'oku barikwenda; turi omu busaasi bwingi munonga.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:10">2 Bus 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:3">Ezr 10:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'ebyo byona twaza kuragaana endagaano, tugihandiikye, abakuru baitu, Abaleevi baitu n'abanyamurwa baitu, bagiteho akamanyiso kaabo.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abaataire akamanyiso aha ndagaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Abaataireho akamanyiso nibo aba: Nehemia omutegyeki mwene Hakalia, Zedekia, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:2-21">Neh 12:2-21</ref>. </char></note> Seraaya, Azaria, Yeremia, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pashihuuri, Amaria, Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatushi, Shebania, Maluki, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harimu, Meremoosi, Obadia, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Danieli, Ginesooni, Baruki, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshulaamu, Abiya, Miyamiini, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maazia, Biligai, Shemaaya; abo bakaba bari abanyamurwa. <verse eid="NEH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Abaleevi nibo aba: Yeshua mweene Azania, Binui ow'omuri beene Henadaadi, na Kadimieli; <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />na beene waabo n'aba, Shebania, Hodia, Kelita, Pelaya, Hanai, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Miika, Rehobu, Hashabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuri, Sherebia, Shebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia, Baani, na Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:8-42">Neh 7:8-42</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:3-35">Ezr 2:3-35</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki b'abantu nibo aba: Paroshi, Pahasi-moabu, Elamu, Zaatu, Baani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buuni, Azigaadi, Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya, Biguvai, Adini, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateri, Hezekia, Azuri, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodia, Hashumu, Bezai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harifu, Anatoosi, Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiashi, Meshulaamu, Heziri, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeeli, Zadoki Yadua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Hanani, Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea, Hanania, Hashubu, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheeshi, Piliha, Shobeki, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehumu, Hashabuna, Maaseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahia, Hanani, Anani, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki, Harimu na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 9:2">Neh 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:36-54">Ezr 2:36-54</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'abandi bantu boona, abanyamurwa, Abaleevi, abakumiirizi, abeeshongozi, abaheereza b'omuri hekalu, na boona abaabaire beetaaniise n'amahanga g'omuri egyo nsi, bakoorobera ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, hamwe n'abakazi baabo, batabani baabo, bahara baabo, na boona abaabaire baine obwengye n'okwetegyereza, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:12">Bir 29:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:12">Neh 5:12</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 5:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:106">Zab 119:106</ref>. </char></note> baakwatanisa na beene waabo n'abakungu baabo, baikiriza eby'omukyeeno n'endahiro, kugyendera omu biragiro bya Ruhanga, ebyahairwe Musa omugaragwa we, n'okworobera ebi MUKAMA, Mukama waitu, yaaragiire byona n'okubihikiiriza, hamwe n'emigyenzo n'eby'oburyo ebi yaataireho. <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Ezr 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baagira bati: Titurishwererana na mahanga ag'omuri egi nsi; <verse eid="NEH 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kur 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:10">23:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 23:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lev 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:1">Bir 15:1</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 15:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:12">Neh 5:12</ref>. </char></note> kandi abanyamahanga b'omuri egi nsi, ku barireeta ebintu nari eby'okurya byona kubitunda aha kiro kya sabato, tituribigura ha kiro kya sabato, nari aha kiro kikuru kyona; kandi omu mwaka gwa mushanju turyaraaza ensi, turekye kugihinga, n'obu kwakuba okwihuza omuntu weena eibanja.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kur 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:24">Mat 17:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi twayeteeraho ebiragiro by'okuguma kuha ekicweka kimwe kya kashatu kya shekeli buri mwaka, ahabw'okukora omurimo gw'enju ya Ruhanga waitu; <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:4">2 Bus 2:4</ref>. </char></note> emigaati y'okumurikwa, empongano z'esaano ezihongwa obutoosha, ebitambo by'okwotsya ebitambwa buri izooba, eby'amasabato, eby'emboneko z'ameezi, eby'ebiro bikuru ebyatairweho, eby'ebintu ebirikwera, eby'empongano z'okwihaho ekibi ez'okurihiirira Abaisraeli, n'eby'emirimo yoona ey'omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="NEH 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:1">Neh 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:12">Lev 6:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi twateerera enteenyu abanyamurwa, Abaleevi n'abandi bantu, okumanya oku baraagume nibareeta enku omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu nk'omutoijo, nk'oku amaju aga baatatenkuriitwe gaabaire gari, omu bunaku obwatairweho buri mwaka, kuba ez'okuhemba aha itambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro. <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Kur 23:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi twayemera kureeta emiganuro y'emisiri yaitu, n'ey'ebijuma byona ebya buri muti ebirikuriibwa, omu nju ya MUKAMA buri mwaka; <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kur 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:13">13</ref>. </char></note> n'okureeta emijigaijo ya batabani baitu n'ey'amatungo gaitu, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro, emijigaijo y'ente zaitu n'ey'entaama zaitu, kugireeta omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu, n'okugiha abanyamurwa abarikukorera omuri egyo nju omurimo gw'obuheereza, <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:20">Kub 15:20</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 15:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:12">18:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:4">Bir 18:4</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'okuguma nitureeta omuganuro gw'ebiihuro byaitu, n'empongano ezizongazongiibwe, n'ebijuma ebirikuriibwa eby'aha miti ebirikuriibwa byona, na viinyo n'amajuta, nitubireetera abanyamurwa omu bishengye by'enju ya Ruhanga waitu, n'okuha Abaleevi ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi ky'ebyezire omu misiri yaitu; ahabw'okuba Abaleevi nibo batwara kimwe kya ikumi ky'emisiri y'endembo zaitu zoona. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:26">Kub 18:26</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 9:26">1 Bus 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:11">2 Bus 31:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaleevi ku bariba nibaheebwa kimwe kya ikumi, omunyamurwa, mwene Arooni, agume abeho; bwanyima Abaleevi nabo bareete kimwe kya ikumi ky'ebyo ebi baaheebwa omu nju ya Ruhanga waitu, babite omu bishengye by'enju y'eibiikiro. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:11">Neh 13:11</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:6">Bir 12:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli n'Abaleevi baryaguma bareete empongano z'engano, viinyo n'amajuta, babite omu bishengye, ebirimu ebintu by'Omwanya ogurikwera, bibe eby'abanyamurwa abarikuheereza n'abakumiirizi n'abeeshongozi. Titurireka kuta omutima aha nju ya Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abaatwire omuri Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 10:34">Neh 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:18">11:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:2">Isa 48:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:1">52:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:5">Mat 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:53">27:53</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">Kush 21:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo abeebembezi b'eihanga bakaguma batwire omuri Yerusaalemu, kwonka abandi bantu baateera enteenyu okwiha omuntu omwe ahari buri ikumi kutuura omuri Yerusaalemu orurembo orurikwera, kandi abandi boona abaatsigaireho baaza omu zindi ndembo. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:16">2 Bus 17:16</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baasiima abashaija boona abaayehaireyo n'omutima gwekundiire kutuura Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:2-34">1 Bus 9:2-34</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:43">Ezr 2:43</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 2:55">55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo nibo bategyeki b'amashaza abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu; kwonka omu ndembo za Yuda buri muntu akaba atwire omu kibanja kye omu rurembo rw'owaabo, Abaisraeli, abanyamurwa, Abaleevi, abaheereza b'omuri hekalu, na baijukuru b'abagaragwa ba Sulemaani. <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Omuri Yerusaalemu hakaba harimu bamwe omu Bayuda n'omu Babenyamiini. Omuri beene Yuda, Ataaya mwene Uziya, mwijukuru wa Zekaria, Zekaria ya Amaria, Amaria ya Shefatia, Shefatia ya Mehalaleeli, ow'omuri beene Pereezi; <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />na Maaseya mwene Baruki, mwijukuru wa Kolihoze, Kolihoze ya Hazaaya, Hazaaya ya Adaaya, Adaaya ya Yoyaribu, Yoyaribu ya Zekaria owa Shiilo. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Beene Pereezi boona abaabaire batwire Yerusaalemu bakaba bari abashaija amamanzi magana ana na makumi mukaaga na munaana.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Kandi aba nibo beene Benyamiini: Saalu mwene Meshulaamu mwijukuru wa Yoedi, Yoedi ya Pedaaya, Pedaaya ya Kolaaya, Kolaaya ya Maaseya, Maaseya ya Ityeli, Ityeli ya Yeshaaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Yaakuratwa Gabai, na Salai, boona magana mwenda na makumi abiri na munaana. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli mwene Zikuri akaba ari omureeberezi waabo; kandi Yuda mwene Hasenua ari owa kabiri omu bategyeki b'orurembo. <verse eid="NEH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Omu banyamurwa: Yedaaya mwene Yoyaribu, Yakiini, <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraya mwene Hilukia, mwijukuru wa Meshulaamu, Meshulaamu ya Zadoki, Zadoki ya Merayosi, Merayosi ya Ahitubu, omutegyeki w'enju ya Ruhanga, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />hamwe na beene waabo abaabaire nibakora omurimo gw'enju, boona magana abiri na makumi abiri na babiri; kandi na Adaya mwene Yerohaamu, mwijukuru wa Pelalia, Pelalia ya Amuzi, Amuzi ya Zekaria, Zekaria ya Pashihuuri, Pashihuuri ya Malukiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />hamwe na beene ishe, abategyeki b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, boona magana abiri na makumi ana na babiri; kandi na Amashisai mwene Azareeli, mwijukuru wa Ahazai, Ahazai ya Meshilemoosi, Meshilemoosi ya Imeri, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />hamwe na beene ishe, abashaija b'amaani amamanzi igana na makumi abiri na munaana; kandi omureeberezi waabo akaba ari Zabudieli mwene Hagedolimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Kandi omu Baleevi: Shemaaya mwene Hashubu, mwijukuru wa Azurikaamu, Azurikaamu ya Hashabia, Hashabia ya Buuni, <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />kandi na Shebatai na Yoazabaadi ab'omu bategyeki ab'omu Baleevi, abaabaire bareeberera emirimo y'enju ya Ruhanga ey'aheeru; <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:8">Neh 12:8</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:25">25</ref>. </char></note> kandi na Matania mwene Miika, mwijukuru wa Zabudi, Zabudi ya Asafu, owaabaire ari omutegyeki w'okwebembera abarikuhimbisa omu kushaba, na Bakibukia owaabaire ari owa kabiri ahari beene ishe, na Abuda mwene Shamua, mwijukuru wa Galali, Galali ya Yedusuuni. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:1">Neh 11:1</ref>. </char></note> Abaleevi boona ab'omu rurembo orurikwera bakaba bari magana abiri na makumi munaana na bana.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Kandi abakumiirizi Akubu, Talumooni na beene waabo, abaabaire barinda amarembo, boona bakaba bari igana na makumi mushanju na babiri. <verse eid="NEH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Abandi Baisraeli boona n'abandi banyamurwa n'Abaleevi, bakaba batwire omu ndembo za Yuda zoona buri muntu omu buhunguzi bwe. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:26">Neh 3:26</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abaheereza b'omuri hekalu bakaba batwire Ofeli, nibareebererwa Ziiha na Gishupa. <verse eid="NEH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Omureeberezi w'Abaleevi omuri Yerusaalemu akaba ari Uuzi mwene Baani, mwijukuru wa Hashabia, Hashabia ya Matania, Matania ya Miika ow'omuri beene Asafu, abeeshongozi, abaabaire bareeberera omurimo gw'enju ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:47">Neh 12:47</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:8">Ezr 6:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:20">7:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba omugabe akaba aragiire ebyabo, kandi agyereire abeeshongozi egabo ya buri izooba. <verse eid="NEH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Kandi Pesahia mwene Meshezabeeli, ow'omuri beene Zeera, mwene Yuda, akaba ari omuntu w'omugabe owaabaire amuhwera omuri byona ebirikufa aha bantu.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 14:15">Yos 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:11">21:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi aha birikukwata aha birorero n'emisiri yaabyo, abamwe aha Bayuda bakaba batwire Kiryasi-araba n'omu birorero byayo, Diboni n'omu birorero byayo, Yekabuzeeli n'omu birorero byayo, <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Yeshua, Molada, Besi-peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Hazarishuali, Beeri-sheba n'omu birorero byayo, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Zikulaagi, Mekona n'omu birorero byayo, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Enirimooni, Zoora, Yaramuusi, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:8">Yos 15:8</ref>. </char></note> Zanoa, Adulaamu n'omu birorero byayo, Lakishi n'emisiri yaayo, na Azaka n'omu birorero byayo. Nikwo bateire batyo ensiisira okuruga Beeri-sheba okuhika omu ruhanga rwa Hinoomu. <verse eid="NEH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Ababenyamiini bakatuura okuruga Geeba n'okweyongyera omu maisho, Mikimaashi, Aiya, Beseeli n'omu birorero byayo, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Anatoosi, Noobu, Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazora, Raama, Gitaimu, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadidi, Zeboimu, Nebalaati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Loodi, na Ono, oruhanga rw'abanyamyoga. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Kandi ebicweka bimwe by'Abaleevi omuri Yuda bakateeranwa na Benyamiini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abaizire na Zerubabeeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1-7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 10:2-8">Neh 10:2-8</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:12-21">12:12-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba nibo banyamurwa n'Abaleevi abaizire na Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli, na Yeshua: Seraya, Yeremia, Ezera,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:1">Ezr 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 2:2">2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amaria, Maluki, Hatushi, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekani, Rehumu, Meremoosi, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Ginesooni, Abiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamiini, Maadia, Biliga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaaya, Yoyaribu, Yedaaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Saalu, Amoki, Hilukia, na Yedaaya. Abo nibo baabaire bari bakuru omu banyamurwa n'omuri beene waabo omu biro bya Yeshua.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 11:17">Neh 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:24">12:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abaleevi n'aba: Yeshua, Binui, Kadimieli, Sherebia, Yuda, na Matania, owaabaire naakwatanisa na beene ishe kwebembera ebyeshongoro by'okuhimbisa. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Kandi Bakibukia na Uuno beene waabo bakaba beemerera nibareebana omu kushaba. <verse eid="NEH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yeshua akazaara Yoyakimu, Yoyakimu yaazaara Eliashibu, Eliashibu yaazaara Yoyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada yaazaara Yonasaani, na Yonasaani yaazaara Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Abanyamurwa b'omu biro bya Yoyakimu abaabaire bari bakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, n'aba: ow'enju ya Seraaya akaba ari Meraaya, ow'eya Yeremia, ari Hanania, <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />ow'eya Ezera, ari Meshulaamu, ow'eya Amaria ari Yehohanani, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />ow'eya Maluki ari Yonasaani, ow'eya Shebania ari Yosefu, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />ow'eya Harimu ari Aduna, ow'eya Merayosi ari Helekai, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />ow'eya Ido ari Zekaria, ow'eya Ginesooni ari Meshulaamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />ow'eya Biya ari Zikiri, ow'eya Minyamiini owa Moadia, ari Pilutai, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />ow'eya Biliga ari Shamua, ow'eya Shemaaya ari Yehonasani, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />ow'eya Yoyaribu ari Matenai, ow'eya Yedaaya ari Uuzi, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />ow'eya Salai ari Kalai, ow'eya Amoki ari Eberi, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />ow'eya Hilukia ari Hashabia, n'ow'eya Yedaaya ari Netaneeli. <verse eid="NEH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Omu biro bya Eliashibu, Yoyada, Yohanaani na Yadua, Abaleevi n'abanyamurwa bakaba bahandiikwa omu kitabo ky'amaziina g'abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo, okuhitsya omu busingye bwa Dario Omuperisi. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:14-16">1 Bus 9:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Bus 25:1</ref>. </char></note> Na beene Leevi, abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkurubo bakaba bahandiikwa omu kitabo ky'eb'omu busingye okuhitsya omu biro bya Yohanaani mwene Eliashibu. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Bus 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abakuru b'Abaleevi bakaba abari Hashabia, Sherebia, na Yeshua mwene Kadimieli, abaabaire bakwatanisa na beene waabo abaabaire beemerera nibareebana, kuhimbisa n'okusiima, nk'ekiragiro kya Daudi omushaija wa Ruhanga oku kyabaire kiri, nibakikora omu mbu zaabo. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Kandi Matania, Bakibukia, Obadia, Meshulaamu, Talumooni na Akubu bakaba bari abakumiirizi, abaabaire barinda amaju g'amabiikiro g'aha marembo. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:9">Neh 8:9</ref>. </char></note> Abo nibo baabaire bariho omu biryo bya Yoyakimu mwene Yeshua, mwijukuru wa Yozadaaki, n'omu biro bya Nehemia omutegyeki na Ezera omunyamurwa, kandi omuhandiiki.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obugyenyi bw'okweza orugo rw'amabaare rwa Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 15:16">1 Bus 15:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibenda kweza orugo rw'amabaare rwa Yerusaalemu, bakasherura Abaleevi ahu baabaire batwire hoona, kubareeta Yerusaalemu aha bugyenyi bw'okurweza baine okushemererwa, nibahimbisa n'ebyenshongoro, baine ebitaasa n'endingiri n'enanga. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Kandi abaana b'abeeshongozi baateeranira hamwe nibaruga omu mpita ezeehinguririize Yerusaalemu n'omu birorero by'Abanetofa, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />na Besi-gilugaali n'omu byaro bya Geeba na Azimavesi; ahabw'okuba abeeshongozi bakaba beeyombekyeire ebirorero embaju zoona eza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:22">Neh 13:22</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baayeyeza, baayeza n'abantu n'amarembo n'orwo rugo rw'amabaare.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Bwanyima naatembya abakuru ba Yuda aha mutwe gw'orwo rugo, naabaganisa abantu omu mitwe ebiri mihango okugyenda aha mutwe gw'orugo bakurataine nibahimbisa. Omutwe gumwe gwatoora aha rubaju rwa buryo, gugyemire ow'Eirembo ry'orubungo; <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />baakuratwa Hoshaaya n'ekicweka ky'abakuru ba Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />na Azaria, Ezera, Meshulaamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda, Benyamiini, Shemaaya, Yeremia, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />n'abatabani b'abanyamurwa abamwe baine amakondere, Zekaria, mwene Yonasaani, mwijukuru wa Shemaaya, Shemaaya ya Matania, Matania ya Mikaaya, Mikaaya ya Zikuri, mwene Asafu; <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:5">1 Bus 23:5</ref>. </char></note> na beene waabo Shemaaya, Azareeli, Yuda na Hanani, baine ebirikugamba bya Daudi omushaija wa Ruhanga, beebembeirwe Ezera omuhandiiki. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:15">Neh 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikire aha Irembo ry'enshuro, bainamuka bagyemire omu maisho gaabo, baatembera aha matembero agarikuza omu rurembo rwa Daudi, ahu orugo rwabaire nirwinamukira aharuguru y'enju ya Daudi, baahika aha Irembo ry'amaizi ery'oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Ogundi mutwe gw'abarikugyenda nibahimbisa gwatoora aha rubaju rwa bumosho, naanye naagyenda mbakuratiire aha mutwe gw'orugo, nyine ekicweka ky'abantu, twatoora aha rubaju rw'omunaara gw'ebikoomi, twahika aha rugo ruhanga, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />bwanyima twaraba aha Irembo rya Efuraimu, n'aha Irembo rya ira, n'aha Irembo ry'eby'enyanja, n'aha munaara gwa Hananeeli, n'aha gwa Hameeya, twahika aha Irembo ry'entaama, twayemerera aha Irembo ry'abakumiirizi. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Etyo egyo mitwe yombi y'abantu abarikusiima yaayemerera omu nju ya Ruhanga, hamwe naanye n'ekicweka ky'abatware abu naabaire nyine, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />n'abanyamurwa Eliakimu, Maaseya, Minyamiini, Mikaaya, Elio-enai, Zekaria na Hanania baine amakondere; <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />kandi na Maaseya, Shemaaya, Eleazaari, Uuzi, Yehohanani, Malikiya, Elamu na Ezeri. Kandi abeeshongozi baayeshongora n'amaraka mahango, nibeebemberwa Yezerahia. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Eryo izooba baatamba ebitambo bingi nibashemererwa; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akaba abahaire okushemererwa kwingi; kandi abakazi n'abaana bato nabo baashemererwa. Kyareetera akaari k'okushemererwa kw'omuri Yerusaalemu kuhuririrwa hare.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 13:4">Neh 13:4</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:11">2 Bus 31:11</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 31:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima eryo izooba baatoorana abantu b'okureeberera ebishengye by'amabiikiro, agarikubiikwamu emitoijo, n'emiganuro, n'ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi, n'okuteeraniramu emigabo y'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi nk'ebiragiro oku birikuragiira, nk'oku emisiri y'endembo zaabo yaabaire eri; ahabw'okuba Abayuda bakashemererwa ahabw'okureeba abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi bari ha mirimo yaabo; <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45, 46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Bus 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:14">2 Bus 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:30">29:30</ref>. </char></note> nibakora emirimo ya Ruhanga waabo n'okuhikiiriza eby'okweyeza; kandi abeeshongozi n'abakumiirizi nabo nikwo baabaire nibatwaza, nibakuratira ekiragiro kya Daudi n'eky'omutabani Sulemaani. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Ahabw'okuba ira omu biro bya Daudi na Asafu hakaba hariho omwebembezi w'abeeshongozi, n'ebyenshongoro by'okuhimbisa Ruhanga n'okumusiima. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Kub 18:21</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:26-28">26-28</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:23">Neh 11:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu biro bya Zerubabeeli n'omu bya Nehemia Abaisraeli boona bakaba bahayo emigabo ya buri izooba ahabw'abeeshongozi n'abakumiirizi; kandi baihaho eby'okubiikira Abaleevi, n'Abaleevi baihaho eby'okubiikira beene Arooni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemia okushemeza emigyenzo y'omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:3-5">Bir 23:3-5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eryo izooba bakashomera abantu eby'omu kitabo kya Musa, baashanga hahandiikirwemu ku hatariho Muamoni nari Omumoabu orikwikirizibwa kuza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba Ruhanga ebiro byona;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:11">Bir 31:11</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:12">12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />ahabw'okuba tibarabuganiise Baisraeli by'okurya na maizi, kureka bakaguriirira Balamu ngu abakyeene; kwona Ruhanga waitu yaahindura ogwo mukyeeno kuba omugisha. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:38">Kur 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:4">Kub 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:2">Neh 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Abantu ku baahuriire Ebiragiro, baiha omu Baisraeli ekijwangye kyona ekirikukomooka omu banyamahanga.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 2:10">Neh 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:1">3:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:44">12:44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ebyo bitakabaireho, Eliashibu omunyamurwa, owaatairweho kutegyeka enju ya Ruhanga waitu, ahabw'okugira obuzaare na Tobia, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Kub 18:21</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:24">24</ref>. </char></note> akaba amushemereize ekishengye kihango, ekyabaire kibiikwamu ira empongano z'esaano, obubaane, ebirikukoresibwa, ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi eby'eby'okurya na viinyo n'amajuta, ebyabaire biragiirwa kuheebwa Abaleevi, abeeshongozi n'abakumiirizi, hamwe n'emitoijo erikutoijwa ahabw'abanyamurwa. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:14">Neh 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka obu ebyo byakorwa, nkaba ntari Yerusaalemu; ahabw'okuba omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu n'ebiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Aruta-gizakiseesi omugabe wa Babulooni, nkaba ngiire ow'omugabe. Bwanyima ku haahingwireho ebiro, naashaba omugabe ngu anyohereze, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />naagaruka Yerusaalemu; ku naahikireyo, naamanya ekibi eki Eliashibu yaakozire ahabw'okushemereza Tobia ekishengye omu bikaari by'enju ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Naagira ekiniga kingi, naahuruutura ebintu bya Tobia byona omuri ekyo kishengye, naabinaga aheeru. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:15">2 Bus 29:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naaragiira ku bashemeza ebyo bishengye; bwanyima naagaruramu ebintu by'enju ya Ruhanga, hamwe n'empongano z'esaano n'obubaane.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 12:28">Neh 12:28</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:4">2 Bus 31:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:8">Mal 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naamanya ku Abaleevi batarahairwe migabo yaabo; n'ahabw'ekyo Abaleevi n'abeeshongozi, abaabaire bakora emirimo, bakaba bahungire, buri muntu agarukire omu kibanja kye. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:39">Neh 10:39</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naahana abatware ningira nti: N'enki ekyareeteire enju ya Ruhanga kutsigwaho? Ahonaaho naateerana Abaleevi, naabagarura omu myanya yaabo. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:38">Neh 10:38</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 10:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:44">12:44</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima aba Yuda boona baareeta kimwe kya ikumi ky'eby'okurya na viinyo n'amajuta, baabita omu mabiikiro. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Neh 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:12">2 Bus 31:12</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 31:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:2">1 Kor 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naataho ababiiki aba kurinda amabiikiro, Shelemia omunyamurwa, Zadoki omuhandiiki na Pedaaya ow'omu Baleevi, nibahwerwa Hanani mwene Zakuri, mwijukuru wa Matania, ahakuba bakaba nibateekateekwa kuba abeesigwa; omurimo gwabo gukaba guri ogw'okugaburira beene waabo. <verse eid="NEH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:19">Neh 5:19</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga wangye, onyijukye ahabw'ekyo, kandi otaragaza emirimo yangye emirungi ei nkoreire enju ya Ruhanga wangye, kandi n'omurimo ogurikukorerwa omuriyo.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemia okushemeza emigyenzo ya sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 10:31">Neh 10:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo nkareeba omuri Yuda abashaija nibanyuukira emizaabibu omu inyuukiro ahari sabato, abandi nibareeta ebiba, nibabyekoreza endogoya zaabo; naareeba na viinyo n'emizaabibu n'ebijuma by'emitiini n'emitwaro y'emiringo yoona, ei baabaire bareeta Yerusaalemu aha izooba rya sabato; naabateiseza aha eizooba eri baabaire nibatundiraho eby'okurya. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Kandi n'abashaija ba Tuuro, abaabaire batwire omu rurembo, bakaba bareeta eby'enyanja, n'ebintu by'emiringo yoona, babiguza aba Yuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ahari sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Ku naabireebire, naatonganisa abakungu ba Yuda, naabagira nti: Ahabw'enki nimukora ekibi ekirikushusha kiti, kushiisha eizooba rya sabato? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:19-23">Yer 17:19-23</ref>. </char></note> Na baashwenkuriimwe tikwo baakozire batyo, kikareetera Ruhanga waitu okutureetaho akabi aka koona, n'aha rurembo oru? Mbwenu imwe nimweyongyera kureeta ahari Israeli ekiniga ahabw'okushiisha sabato.<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:32">Lev 23:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba eririkukuratwa sabato omu mwabazyo nibutandika kwira, ku naabaire ndi aha irembo rya Yerusaalemu, naaragiira kukinga amarembo, kandi kutagaruka kwigurwa okuhitsya obu sabato eraahwe. Kandi naataho bamwe aha bashaija bangye kurinda amarembo, ngu hatagira omutwaro gwona ogu baataasyamu aha izooba rya sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Bwanyima abashuubuzi n'abarikutunda ebintu by'emiringo yoona baaraara enyima ya Yerusaalemu ekiro kimwe nari bibiri. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Ku naabareebire, naabahana nimbagira nti: N'enki ekibaraarize enyima y'orugo? Ku muraagarukire, niinyija kubakwata. Okuruga obwo tibaagaruka kwija ahari sabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:30">Neh 12:30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naaragiira Abaleevi kweyeza, ngu babone kwija kurinda amarembo, eizooba rya sabato rirekye kusiisikara. Ai Ruhanga wangye, onyijukye n'ahabw'ekyo, kandi onsaasire nk'embabazi zaawe nyingi oku ziri.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemia okuhana abarikushwererana n'abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 4:7">Neh 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:1">13:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:10">Ezr 10:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuri ebyo biro naareeba Abayudaaya abaashweire abakazi b'omuri Ashidoodi, n'Abaamonikazi, n'Abamoabukazi, <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />kandi abaana baabo bakaba bagamba orurimi rwabo nibarujwanzya n'orurimi rw'aba Ashidoodi, batarikubaasa kugamba gye ruyudaaya, kureka bagambaho rumwe ahari ezo. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:29">Neh 10:29</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 10:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:5">Ezr 10:5</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naabatonganisa nimbajuma, nangwa na bamwe omuribo naabateera, naabamaanyura eishokye, naabarahiza omu iziina rya Ruhanga, nti: Mutarihingirana nabo, kandi naimwe mutaribashweramu. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">2 Sam 12:24</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:13">1 Bag 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">11:1-8</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya ku Sulemaani omugabe wa Israeli yaasiisire ahabw'abakazi nk'aba? N'obu haraabe hatarabaireho mugabe ondiijo owaashushaine nawe omu mahanga maingi, kandi Ruhanga we yaamukunzire, akamugira omugabe wa Israeli yoona, kwonka nawe abanyamahangakazi bakamusiisisa. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:2">Ezr 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nimugira ngu nitwija kwikiriza ebyanyu, tukore ekibi ekirikwingana kiti, kushwera abanyamahangakazi? <verse eid="NEH 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:10">Neh 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 2:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omwe ahari batabani ba Yehoyada mwene Eliashibu omunyamurwa omukuru, akaba ari mukwe wa Sanibalati Omuhoroni; nikyo naamubingiire omu maisho gangye. <verse eid="NEH 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:14">Neh 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:4">Mal 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ai Ruhanga wangye, ogume obaijukye, ahabw'okuba bakashiisha obunyamurwa, n'endagaano y'obunyamurwa n'ey'Abaleevi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 10:30">Neh 10:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo naabashemeize, nkabamaramu abanyamahanga boona, nkataho embu z'abanyamurwa n'ez'Abaleevi, buri muntu kukora omurimo gwe; <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:34">Neh 10:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nkaragiira eby'okureeta emitoijo y'enku omu bunaku obutairweho, n'eby'emiganuro. Ai Ruhanga wangye, ogume onyijukye, onzimuurire ebirungi.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>